                "assessment": "当前表达不够合适",
                "naturalExpression": "How do I get there from here?",
                "explanation": "直接提问需要疑问语序：将“can / should / will”等放在主语前；若使用实义动词，则根据时态补上“do / does / did”。"
              },
              "rewards": [
                {
                  "type": "stat",
                  "stat": "speaking",
                  "amount": 0
